               PERFORM EXPAND-VALUE-0007.
               PERFORM FORMAT-EXCESS-0008.
               PERFORM FORMAT-TAX-BAND-0009.
               PERFORM RESOLVE-BROKER-ID-0010.
               PERFORM NORMALISE-BEDROOMS-0012.
